Credits / provenance
====================

This repository builds standalone-Linux adbd .apk packages for Alpine from
nmeum/android-tools release sources (https://github.com/nmeum/android-tools).

The Linux-adbd enablement (crypto removal, FunctionFS USB, auth/jdwp stubs,
CMake recipe) is the work of happyme531 in
https://github.com/happyme531/standalone-linux-adbd. Patches are used verbatim
where noted. Patch authorship is preserved in each patch file's From: header.

From happyme531/standalone-linux-adbd (verbatim):
  adbd/0029-adb-add-Linux-TCP-only-daemon-support.patch
  adbd/0030-adb-enable-FunctionFS-USB-on-standalone-Linux.patch
  adbd/vendor-CMakeLists.txt           (derived from his vendor/CMakeLists.txt
                                        edits; replaces the file outright so no
                                        context can rot on version bumps)
  adbd/CMakeLists.adbd-daemon.txt     (verbatim except for two small additions:
                                        sockets_utils.cpp for android-tools
                                        >= 37, and a libatomic check needed on
                                        riscv64)
  adbd/adbd-stubs.cpp                  (vendor/linux-adbd/stubs.cpp; one
                                        help string reworded for USB builds)
  adbd/sys-capability.h                (vendor/linux-adbd/include/sys/capability.h)
  cmake/toolchains/aarch64-linux-gnu.cmake
  cmake/toolchains/armv7-linux-gnueabihf.cmake   (same layout, retargeted)
  cmake/toolchains/riscv64-linux-gnu.cmake       (same layout, retargeted)

Original (Mio Naganohara <mio@meow.business>):
  adbd/0031-adbd-linux-reboot-service.patch
  adbd/0032-adbd-linux-no-tcp-fallback.patch
  adbd/0033-adbd-linux-shell-tmpdir.patch
  adbd/0034-usb-ffs-rename-strings-variable.patch
  adbd/adbd.initd, adbd/adbd.confd, adbd/APKBUILD, scripts/,
  .github/workflows/

